{"id": "en_desert_car_p2", "total": 68.69, "segments": [{"text": "Part two. The sun shifted in midday, leaving Jake exposed to direct extreme desert heat without shade.", "start": 0.0, "end": 5.74}, {"text": "Jake faces a dangerous choice as scorching rays beat down on his unprotected desert location.", "start": 6.28, "end": 10.76}, {"text": "He remembers the golden rules of survival to beat the deadly heat without making mistakes.", "start": 11.4, "end": 14.9}, {"text": "One. Stay with the car because a vehicle is much easier to spot from the sky.", "start": 14.57, "end": 19.46}, {"text": "Jake stays right beside his broken vehicle instead of wandering blindly into the vast wasteland.", "start": 20.08, "end": 23.78}, {"text": "Two. Rest in the shade during the hottest hours and move only in cool mornings.", "start": 23.41, "end": 27.9}, {"text": "Jake moves safely back to the rock shelter as the sun angle changes slightly overhead.", "start": 28.44, "end": 32.04}, {"text": "He stays near the rock shadow, resting his body while waiting for rescue teams.", "start": 32.4, "end": 35.66}, {"text": "Three. Drink the water you have when thirsty because rationing water while overheating fails.", "start": 35.819, "end": 40.62}, {"text": "Jake drinks his water normally, ignoring harmful myths about saving every single last drop.", "start": 41.4, "end": 45.14}, {"text": "He checks his phone, keeping it safely stored away until he finally gets cell signal.", "start": 45.78, "end": 49.72}, {"text": "Jake raises the car hood higher, using a small mirror to flash bright sunlight.", "start": 50.42, "end": 53.72}, {"text": "He waves his arms toward the horizon, signaling clearly near his shaded vehicle spot.", "start": 54.15, "end": 57.6}, {"text": "A rescue plane spots the bright car reflection and turns toward Jake in the desert.", "start": 58.06, "end": 61.26}, {"text": "Smart choices in extreme heat save lives. Follow for a new scenario tomorrow.", "start": 61.88, "end": 65.54}